  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/1d/c9/41/1dc94136fe02dcfb8bcc07dc04f16a28.png\" alt=\"侏羅紀世界重生II 橫幅\" width=\"1124\" height=\"591\"></p><p>‎ ‎ <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMqZhxk7gA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/831803522281635850?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=4a94fb&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"172\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"https://patreon.com/KnightDexx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=KnightDexx&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"166\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Rent -a server-9cf?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Codeforces&amp;logoColor=cyan\" alt=\"租用伺服器\" width=\"139\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dexxknight1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-modpacks-red?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"我的模組包\" width=\"132\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdexxknight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Support me on Ko-fi&amp;color=C0C0C0&amp;labelColor=4a94fb&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\" width=\"179\" height=\"24\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fjurassic-world-reborn-ii%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1ji64K.png\" alt=\"MMC評論\" width=\"390\" height=\"65\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦕 歡迎來到侏羅紀世界重生II 🦕</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">踏入一個過去重現生機、遠古巨獸再次漫步大地的世界。<strong>侏羅紀世界重生II</strong> 邀請你展開一場穿越時空的非凡探險，在這裡，科學與史前奇蹟交織，世界的每個角落都蘊藏著等待發掘的新發現。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">這不僅是生存——這是一場史詩級的<strong>古生物冒險</strong>。從遠古化石中萃取 DNA，培育數百萬年來未曾在地球上漫步的生物，並建立你自己的侏羅紀保護區。從海洋爬行動物悄然滑行的深海，到翼龍雄偉翱翔的天空，每個生態群落都成為通往地球遠古時代的一扇窗。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">但史前世界只是開端。穿越神秘維度，掌握強大科技，精通奧秘魔法，並與其他探險者結盟。你將成為聲名遠播的古生物學家、繪製未知領域的大膽冒險家，還是創造終極恐龍公園的遠見建築師？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">憑藉強化的視覺效果、沉浸式環境音效，以及精心打造的生態系統，這個模組天堂中的每一刻都宛如一場真實的遠征。遠處火山隆隆作響，瀑布奔流於茂密叢林，遠古生物的叫聲在荒野中迴盪。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>恐龍時代已經回歸。你準備好回應召喚了嗎？</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#06c\"><strong>💻 系統需求</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>建議記憶體：</strong>分配 16GB 至 20GB 給 Minecraft</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Java：</strong>需要 Java 17+（使用<a href=\"https://github.com/TheUsefulLists/UsefulMods/blob/main/JavaArgumentsOptimization.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">最佳化 Java 參數</a>以獲得最佳效能）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine：</strong>❌ 與此模組包不相容（光影已透過 Oculus/Rubidium 內建）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft 版本：</strong>1.20.1 Forge</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/b4/98/40/b4984061a92d4685ff76ac6302586825.png\" alt=\"特色橫幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#c00\"><strong>🎯 是什麼讓侏羅紀世界重生II與眾不同？</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦖 史前生命與恐龍</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>560+ 個模組</strong>，精心挑選以打造終極侏羅紀體驗</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jurassic-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jurassic Reborn（JR）</a> - 包含 <strong>108 種不同生物</strong>，包括恐龍、海洋爬行動物、史前魚類和基因雜交種</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fossils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fossils &amp; Archeology</a> - 超過 <strong>60+ 種史前生物</strong>，可透過考古探索復活</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">萃取 DNA、孵化蛋，並飼養你自己的史前夥伴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建立自訂棲息地，觀察逼真的恐龍行為</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🌍 可供探索的維度</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> - 充滿神秘與遠古遺跡的魔法森林領域</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> - 基岩下方具有獨特生態系統的廣闊地下維度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a> - Everbright 和 Everdawn 兩個天界領域，擁有浮空島嶼</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以及更多充滿史前秘密和寶藏的維度！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🔍 探索與冒險</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">發現埋藏在世界各處的隱藏<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2\" rel=\"nofollow\">寶藏</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">探索神秘的地牢和廢棄建築</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">發掘沉船和水下考古遺址</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr</a> - 多人伺服器上每位玩家的個人化戰利品系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reskillable</a> - 高達 <strong>8 種自訂技能</strong>，用於角色成長</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>✨ 魔法與神秘學</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> - 自然魔法與魔力操控</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a> - 可自訂的咒語製作系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/psi\" rel=\"nofollow\">PSI</a> - 可透過視覺化程式設計建立可程式化法術</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">運用魔法能量強化你的史前探險</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚔️ 武器、盔甲與工具</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> - 多樣化的近戰和遠程武器庫</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero Guns</a> - 用於防衛的現代槍械</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Construct</a> - 自訂工具鍛造與材料組合</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抵禦攻擊性的史前掠食者和競爭對手探險者</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🏛️ 裝飾與建築</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decocraft</a> - 數千種裝飾物品可美化你的基地</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/engineers-decor-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">Engineer's Decor Ported</a> - 工業主題裝飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel Reborn</a> - 數百種方塊變體</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisels &amp; Bits</a> - 用於精細設計的微方塊建築</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> - 強化建築選項</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bibliocraft Legacy</a> - 家具與儲物解決方案</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打造終極恐龍公園、研究設施或史前博物館！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>💎 獨特文物與遺物</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts</a> - 具有特殊能力的強大可穿戴物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics</a> - 帶有神秘特性的遠古寶藏</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">發掘賦予非凡力量的傳說級物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">組合文物以創造終極探險家裝備</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>📦 儲物解決方案</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> - 先進數位儲存網路</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage</a> - 易於使用的物品管理系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a> - 緊湊型大量儲物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a> - 可升級的儲物容器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> - 可升級的便攜儲物</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有效率地整理你的化石、DNA樣本和史前發現</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚙️ 科技與自動化</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> - 機械裝置與動能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-foundation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Series</a> - 發電與礦石處理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-io\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender IO</a> - 導管與機器自動化</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> - 先進機械與數位採礦</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a> - 多方塊機器與佈線</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-foregoing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Foregoing</a> - 資源處理與農場</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/draconic-evolution\" rel=\"nofollow\">Draconic Evolution</a> - 終局科技與能源</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/void-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Void Miners</a> - 自動化資源提取</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自動化你的恐龍繁殖計畫和資源收集！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚡ 能源生成</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-reactors\" rel=\"nofollow\">極端反應爐</a> - 核能發電滿足龐大能源需求</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\">先進發電機</a> - 多燃料動力系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solar-flux-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">太陽通量重生</a> - 潔淨太陽能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flux-networks\" rel=\"nofollow\">通量網絡</a> - 無線能量傳輸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為你的研究設施與收容系統提供電力</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#228b22\"><strong>📊 模組包統計</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>560+ 個模組</strong> 精心挑選並配置</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>108 種史前生物</strong> 來自侏羅紀重生</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>60+ 種可復活生物</strong> 來自化石與考古</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>3 個主要維度</strong> 加上地獄與終界</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>8 種自訂技能</strong> 透過 Reskillable</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>無數結構</strong> 與探索機會</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>專業品質</strong> - 為流暢遊戲體驗最佳化</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/65/32/56/6532567a92d1b504e57aafc36700abdb.png\" alt=\"伺服器託管橫幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fd1be5c2-6afd-4000-8095-0e31ef4da735.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting 橫幅\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">想和朋友一起玩 <strong>侏羅紀世界重生 II</strong> 嗎？在 <strong>BisectHosting</strong> 獲得高效能伺服器！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#06c\"><strong>💻 伺服器需求</strong></span></